DESC_OF_WORK:
1ST EXTENSION TO SOL19014988, EXTENSION WILL EXPIRE ON 02/08/2021.  ORIGINAL SCOPE:
This project is for DC Water, Blue Plains Campus. The overall project is for the installation of photo-voltaic (PV) Solar consisting of 4.29MW. There are fourteen (14) installation locations on the campus consisting of Rooftop, 7 Buildings, for a total of 1528kW); Ground mount, 1 location, for a total of 368kW; and Carport/Canopies, 4 locations, for a total of 2225kW PV Solar. We are submitting each installation location, individually, to ensure the advancement/approval of each location on its own merits. Per Kevin Winston, the hashtag for this project is #DCWaterAMERESCO. This application is for the Central Operations Facility Carport consisting of 485.6kW, T-Mounted canopy PV solar. 47.9kW; Array 4: location has 7 carports: Array 1: 47.9kW; Array 2: 61.6kW; Array 3: 47.9 kW; Array 4: 88.9; Array 5: 143.6kW; Array 6: 68.4kW;
Array 7: 27.4kW.
